kamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndのアンダーの曲はどんな曲なのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅーしちゃうぞはでるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの個別PVかわぃぃ♪(/ω＼*)服LISLISA?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影で大変だったことは('・ω・`)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デートPVおもしろそうやなw普段もチャットとかするん?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の答えを交えつつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は33人全員がデートってシチュエーションなのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからさすがにサンプラーはできなかったのよね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のテーマはずばり!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャット!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーチャットゆーてメールのはやりとりするんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ画面で映像をつかっての本格的なチャットは初体験でしたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャットいいねー楽しいしょチャット(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもお友達や大好きな人やひめたんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャットするしかー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーわけで寂しいけどチャットする相手おらんーって人は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらひめたんとチャットしてみてね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーTypeCに入ってるよ♪よろしくね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宣伝わら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっつめー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛をPV紹介☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特殊メイクとかもっとじっくり見たい(ノд・。)写メのっけてくれん??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさーい('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんとまりか(伊藤万理華chan)はあの素敵な特殊メイクしてないのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドシングルのPVどんな感じなの?教えてくれない?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうチェックしたよって方はご存知だと思いまーすが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単に言うと、みんな噛み付かれてパンクスになっちゃうのよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、ストーリー的にひめたんもパンクスなるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのパンクス姿は映像にはないとゆー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっというと、ひめたんとまりか(伊藤万理華chan)はパンクスメイクをしてないとゆー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっ詳しいエピソードはあれですよ。おいでストリーミングラジオ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にブログでさらさら〜て書いたけど、チェックしてくださったかな(ω)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ初日の4/28は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「狼に口笛を」のダンスバージョンPVのことをプロモーションしようって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15分くらいの内容なんだけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーわちゃわちゃしてましたよ。わちゃわちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)まあや(和田まあやchan)との3人ぺあってのもまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レアじゃん(^ω^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうとうレアじゃないですかー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃあね、プレミアム感満載だね。聞くしかー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの質問返し!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好きな男性のタイプ教えて!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さほど理想は高くないですよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくて、甘えさせてくれる、お兄ちゃんみたいな人(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶髪と黒髪どっちが好きー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってればどっちもかっこいい(^^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の髪は短い方が好き?それとも長い方が好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまたねー、似合ってればかっこいいんだよねこれが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲を言うなら、おいでシャンプーごほっごほごほごほっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーの香りがねーとかハードルあげてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スウィーツが好きな男性＝『スウィーツ男子』ひめたん的にどう思う?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがスイーツ女子だから、お似合いだぬ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え?そんなこと聞いてないって??わら(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/03/7087270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕は頭痛持ちでたまに偏頭痛が起こるんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんってそうゆうの無いですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偏頭痛は起こらないけど、緊張したり環境が変わったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐお腹いたくなります(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偏頭痛持ちの友達が辛いーって言ってたー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*'・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}